# deck_tiled.fmat — the UV transform, as a material.
#
# A face's offset, scale and rotation were per-face fields, so a corridor of
# plates tiled four-up meant setting the same scale on every one. The material's
# transform is COMPOSED on top of the face's own, so a face that has been
# nudged into place by hand keeps its nudge and gains the tiling.
kind: surface
texture: hull_deck
doc: Deck plate at four repeats per face. Compose-on-top, so a face keeps its own placement.
effects:
  - effect: uv_transform
    scale: [4, 4]
